@database.indexing

Purpose:
  Performance optimization for queries.

Owns: references\database\indexing.sdd
UseWhen:
  - slow query performance
  - large dataset
  - frequent search operations

AvoidWhen:
  - small dataset
  - write-heavy with rare reads

Why:
  Reduces query time from linear to logarithmic.

Types:
  btree:
      General purpose, sorted.

  hash:
      Exact match only.

  gin:
      Full text and arrays.

  gist:
      Geometric and range.

Related:
  @database.transaction

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
